  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Choose the halogen which is most reactive towards SN1 reaction in the given compounds (A, B, C &amp; D)</p><p>A.&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/6f06b262-7155-41aa-bb1a-4ab072dca3c0.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 146px;\" /></p><p>B.&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/bc464402-0744-4ff9-8362-3e7ce7134916.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 54px;\" /></p><p>C.&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/5c8d8b32-a2b3-4f7e-9539-485e2c0c12bf.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 150px;\" /></p><p>D.&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/06c7a3e2-2c93-4164-9a46-4431a3814ecb.png\" style=\"width: 218px; height: 108px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
